HST Office: the Linux launcher search keywords no longer name OpenOffice Writer/Calc/Impress.
The Keywords= entries are not translated, so this one line per launcher covers every locale.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).

--- a/sysui/desktop/menus/calc.desktop
+++ b/sysui/desktop/menus/calc.desktop
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 Comment=Perform calculations, analyze information and manage lists in spreadsheets.
 StartupNotify=true
 X-GIO-NoFuse=true
-Keywords=Accounting;Stats;OpenDocument Spreadsheet;Chart;Microsoft Excel;Microsoft Works;OpenOffice Calc;ods;xls;xlsx;
+Keywords=Accounting;Stats;OpenDocument Spreadsheet;Chart;Microsoft Excel;Microsoft Works;ods;xls;xlsx;
 InitialPreference=5
 StartupWMClass=libreoffice-calc
 X-KDE-Protocols=file,http,webdav,webdavs
--- a/sysui/desktop/menus/impress.desktop
+++ b/sysui/desktop/menus/impress.desktop
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 Comment=Create and edit presentations for slideshows, meetings and Web pages.
 StartupNotify=true
 X-GIO-NoFuse=true
-Keywords=Slideshow;Slides;OpenDocument Presentation;Microsoft PowerPoint;Microsoft Works;OpenOffice Impress;odp;ppt;pptx;
+Keywords=Slideshow;Slides;OpenDocument Presentation;Microsoft PowerPoint;Microsoft Works;odp;ppt;pptx;
 InitialPreference=5
 StartupWMClass=libreoffice-impress
 X-KDE-Protocols=file,http,webdav,webdavs
--- a/sysui/desktop/menus/writer.desktop
+++ b/sysui/desktop/menus/writer.desktop
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 Comment=Create and edit text and graphics in letters, reports, documents and Web pages.
 StartupNotify=true
 X-GIO-NoFuse=true
-Keywords=Text;Letter;Fax;Document;OpenDocument Text;Microsoft Word;Microsoft Works;Lotus WordPro;OpenOffice Writer;CV;odt;doc;docx;rtf;
+Keywords=Text;Letter;Fax;Document;OpenDocument Text;Microsoft Word;Microsoft Works;Lotus WordPro;CV;odt;doc;docx;rtf;
 InitialPreference=5
 StartupWMClass=libreoffice-writer
 X-KDE-Protocols=file,http,webdav,webdavs
